[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4741.35, "timestamp": "01:19:01", "text": "呃，她告诉她的粉丝们去健身房。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4746.47, "timestamp": "01:19:06", "text": "就像有一句话会一直萦绕在我心头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4754.95, "timestamp": "01:19:14", "text": "大声说出来听起来很蠢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4762.709, "timestamp": "01:19:22", "text": "所以我只是为了我的老婆和我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.669, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "我不会憎恨他们所拥有的事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4770.07, "timestamp": "01:19:30", "text": "喜欢。如果他们说喜欢我，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4774.51, "timestamp": "01:19:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4781.59, "timestamp": "01:19:41", "text": "男人。现在我更有动力去尝试了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4785.99, "timestamp": "01:19:45", "text": "健身。我从来没上过。如果你是N jock"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4788.31, "timestamp": "01:19:48", "text": "拥有健康的身体和健康的饮食"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4790.47, "timestamp": "01:19:50", "text": "那么，我就不会向这些人推荐健身房。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4793.11, "timestamp": "01:19:53", "text": "已经拥有健康的生活方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4795.43, "timestamp": "01:19:55", "text": "正确的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4798.87, "timestamp": "01:19:58", "text": "但如果你有时间的话"}]